WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.048
RUFUS: Tool calling means the model can
reach out and use external software

00:00:04.048 --> 00:00:08.095
RUFUS: — run a search, check a database,
trigger another process. The Responses

00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:12.143
RUFUS: API is OpenAI's newer framework
that enables it. What's notable is that

00:00:12.143 --> 00:00:16.190
RUFUS: tool calling is only available
through Responses, not through the older
Chat

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.238
RUFUS: Completions pathway.

00:00:20.348 --> 00:00:24.123
ALEX: So if you want your agent to
actually do things, rather than

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:27.897
ALEX: just describe doing things, you
need the newer plumbing.

00:00:28.007 --> 00:00:30.571
RUFUS: Which means any team still on the
older integration has to migrate

00:00:30.571 --> 00:00:33.135
RUFUS: before they get the full
capability.

00:00:33.315 --> 00:00:35.797
JAMIE: That's not nothing for a larger
company.

00:00:35.977 --> 00:00:40.535
RUFUS: No. But it's a migration with a
clear destination, not a wall.
